  pm-gantt-chart-uidc,discovered_from,"2026-08-17T05:04:47.827Z",codex,"cli:create:dep",detected
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-17T05:14:20.755Z",codex,"TDD and installed acceptance: the public 2026.8.17 SDK checker first returned manifest_unknown_key for the legacy pm block; after removal it returned compatible:true with zero findings. A second clean project installed and activated the package, exposed the exporter flags, rendered a linked three-item schedule, and passed pm health --strict-exit with zero warnings."
files[2]{path,scope,note}:
  manifest.json,project,Removed the unsupported legacy pm compatibility block
  test/compatibility-floor.test.ts,project,Gates the complete raw manifest through the public SDK checker
tests[1]{command,path,scope,timeout_seconds,note}:
  npm run coverage,test/compatibility-floor.test.ts,project,1800,SDK manifest contract regression is included in the exact package coverage run
close_reason: Raw manifest now satisfies the public SDK contract and fresh strict health
